# Checked out with CRLF on Windows, these break inside the Linux container: a shell
# script whose shebang ends in \r fails with "no such file or directory", and the
# Apache config and PHP endpoint are no better off. Everything that the image runs
# stays LF regardless of the machine it was cloned on.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh      text eol=lf
*.conf    text eol=lf
*.php     text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Treat media as binary so Git never "fixes" line endings inside it
*.mp4 binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
